    Reveals\r\n18. Locks with Accepting Affordances\r\n19. Lock Signifiers\r\n20.
    Repetition & Variety in Lock Mechanics\r\n21. Eased State Changes\r\n22. Escape
    Signifiers\r\n23. Escaping the Room\r\n24. Gate Affordance"
